x;color:#888;\">Chinese Nutrition Society</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-title\">中国7~24月龄婴幼儿平衡膳食宝塔</div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-right\">\n    <div class=\"mchn-text\" style=\"text-align:right;\">\n      MCNH-CNS<br>\n      <span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;\">中国营养学会<br>妇幼营养分会</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mchn-logo\">\n      <svg width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\">\n        <rect width=\"40\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#1a6fb5\"/>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"8\">MCNH</text>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"7\">CNS</text>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"subtitle\">依据《中国居民膳食指南(2022)》绘制</div>\n\n<div class=\"main-content\">\n  <!-- Left Panel: Guidelines -->\n  <div class=\"left-panel\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🍼</span>\n        <span>继续母乳喂养</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🥣</span>\n        <span>满6月龄开始添加辅食</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-blue\">🌾</span>\n        <span>从富铁泥糊状谷类和糊状食物开始</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-green\">🥛</span>\n        <span>母乳或乳类充足时不需补钙</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-green\">💊</span>\n        <span>仍需补充维生素D，400IU/d</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-orange\">👶</span>\n        <span>回应式喂养，鼓励逐步自主进食</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-orange\">🍽️</span>\n        <span>逐步过渡到多样化饮食</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-red\">🧂</span>\n        <span>辅食不加或少加盐、糖和调味品</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-purple\">📏</span>\n        <span>定期测量体重和身长</span>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"icon icon-teal\">🧼</span>\n        <span>饮食卫生、食品安全</span>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n   